00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:40.940
point.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:46.170
Last week, you had a caller that mentioned
nurses talking about how the covid vaccine

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:49.609
might cause individuals to misinterpret their
symptoms.

00:00:49.609 --> 00:00:54.649
It seems this discussion of the nurses might
be a misinterpretation of an actual report.

00:00:54.649 --> 00:01:01.019
There is a report that there are, quote, functional
neurological disorders after the vaccine.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.929
I am a neurologist.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:09.260
Functional neurological disorder is the medical
term for what used to be called psychogenic

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.260
symptoms.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:15.360
In other words, folks are reporting symptoms
that are not of medical origin after their

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.360
vaccines.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.020
Below is a summary of the report from Medscape.

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.850
Happy to interpret, but as a brief summary,
there are a number of neurological examination

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:28.740
tricks that neurologists use to identify psychogenic
versus neurological weakness.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.990
One of these is the Hoover sign mentioned
below.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:31.990
Yes.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.799
So this is a really important thing.

00:01:33.799 --> 00:01:44.040
A lot of the time people will not understand
the difference between a symptom and an actual

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.000
physiological side effect of a medication.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:56.650
And for example, you can have a headache after
a vaccine or after a medication or after working

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:58.369
out or whatever.

00:01:58.369 --> 00:02:05.820
It's not that the headache isn't real, but
there may not be a physiological cause for

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:06.820
that.

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.430
But it doesn't make the symptom any less real.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:13.250
And there's a lot of different terms that
are sometimes applied here in different disciplines.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.250
Sometimes people talk about psychosomatic.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.720
We don't even need to go into that.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:21.970
As our viewer here is saying, we're talking
about when we say functional neurological

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:22.970
disorder.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.580
If you don't know what that means, you're
like, whoa, that's how the vaccine causes

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:29.100
a functional neurological disorder.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:33.830
As is being pointed out, that means there
is a symptom which we don't believe to actually

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:39.520
be caused by something going on neurologically.

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:43.340
And this applies in many other areas of medicine
as well.

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:44.400
Very important point.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.770
